        "last_commit_sha": "8db295a",
        "last_commit_message": "Add --skills-dir, --skills and --methodology to the CLI (#1779)\n\n* Add --skills and --skills-dir CLI flags with STRIX_SKILLS_DIR support\n\n--skills loads named skills into the root agent before the scan starts\nand is persisted in run.json so --resume keeps them. --skills-dir and\nSTRIX_SKILLS_DIR add extra skill roots ahead of the packaged set so\ninstalled builds can add or override skills without rebuilding. Docs\nexplain when to use an instruction file versus a skill.\n\n* Add --methodology to apply a file or skill to every agent in a scan\n\n* fix(skills): keep a methodology entry from reusing the wrapper tag\n\nA file named methodology.md rendered as nested <methodology> tags in the\nsystem prompt. Such an entry now uses the tag methodology_rules.",
